&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE openQueryZoomCodigo DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE openQueryZoomCodigo :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

    OPEN QUERY {&QueryName} FOR EACH {&TableName} NO-LOCK
         WHERE {&TableName}.codigo >= v-codigo-ini
           AND {&TableName}.codigo <= v-codigo-fim.

    RETURN "OK":U.

END PROCEDURE.

/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
&ANALYZE-RESUME

